{"id": "DfM1QQTpaI7", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "The sun hadn’t set. Krishna only made them think it had.\nसूर्य डूबा नहीं था। कृष्ण ने बस ऐसा दिखाया था।\n\nArjuna had sworn to kill Jayadratha before sunset, or walk into the fire. With the sun sinking and Jayadratha hidden behind six great warriors, Krishna made a darkness by his yoga. The Kauravas cheered and looked up at the sky, and so did Jayadratha. (Mahabharata, Drona Parva)\n\nThe Sunset Vow, part 4 of 4: the finale.\n\nWas Krishna right to hide the sun? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #arjuna #krishna #jayadratha महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793539779, "like_count": 25164, "comment_count": 184, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28869834929344122a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.671, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPN5buwTDcvzFs0q7Hn7YZT9deD1yTl0f-rDGu-r2UtOTmDX8BUEjCDZp7gwN0Mr2wy2tTmgyreEAJjphdDTL3STaIzkVFmNtH3kOA.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=Ng0LchPJ7bwQ7kNvwE57pAO&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=epynMy4urCwlMuxxEkPg4g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRNSEIQEtNUkn7gaFug4esLfnq0XTUyHVzMpMZkeJQLAA&oe=6AF3D80C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 68.671, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-28869834929344122a - audio